<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Protect your system" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Protect your system</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Enhances system availability by detecting CT secondary wiring faults, reducing the risk of spurious trips and unnecessary outages.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify installation and setup" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify installation and setup</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Design and install easily with standardized external components in an Epsilon case. Our integrated logic effectively configures relay input and output functionality to streamline setup and reduce complexity for your team.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Maintain control remotely" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Maintain control remotely</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Access protection, instrumentation and metering data via device fascia or through a front USB port or remotely using the either the, RS232, RS485 or Ethernet rear ports with IEC61850 protocol. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='7L2C1s207tvU6wkd5CIw82' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='7L2C1s207tvU6wkd5CIw82'><is-land on:visible><